      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is now a thing you can do\n\nAs far as I'm aware if you don't mark a parameter as \"synced\" it doesn't take up parameter memory\n\nThere's IsLocal as a parameter you can use\n\nCtrl + F \"Local\"\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/animator-parameters/\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/state-behaviors/\n\nhttps://vrcfury.com/components/toggle/",
